{"id":11092,"date":"2022-12-02T14:24:46","date_gmt":"2022-12-02T14:24:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=11092"},"modified":"2022-12-02T14:39:20","modified_gmt":"2022-12-02T14:39:20","slug":"rychla-presna-spolehliva-a-levna-analyza-plynu-s-ft-ir-spektrometry-max-ir","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/rychla-presna-spolehliva-a-levna-analyza-plynu-s-ft-ir-spektrometry-max-ir\/","title":{"rendered":"Rychl\u00e1, p\u0159esn\u00e1, spolehliv\u00e1 a levn\u00e1 anal\u00fdza plyn\u016f s FT-IR spektrometry MAX-iR"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Pro mnoh\u00e9 pr\u016fmyslov\u00e9 procesy je naprosto z\u00e1sadn\u00ed m\u00edt spolehlivou techniku, kter\u00e1 umo\u017e\u0148uje rychlou, jednoduchou, p\u0159esnou a bezpe\u010dnou anal\u00fdzu plyn\u016f. Tradi\u010dn\u011b u\u017e\u00edvan\u00e9 metody jako CG \u010di CG-MS jsou v\u0161ak pomal\u00e9 a provoz takov\u00fdch p\u0159\u00edstroj\u016f je p\u0159\u00edli\u0161 n\u00e1kladn\u00fd.<\/p>\n<p>Proto se p\u0159\u00edmo nab\u00edz\u00ed zam\u011b\u0159it pozornost na techniky molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopie. Spole\u010dnost Thermo Scientific nab\u00edz\u00ed p\u0159evratn\u00fd <a href=\"https:\/\/www.thermofisher.com\/cz\/en\/home\/global\/forms\/industrial\/max-ir-ftir-gas-analyzer.html?SID=fr-fl-msd-max-ir-main\"><strong>FT-IR analyz\u00e1tor plyn\u016f MAX-iR<\/strong><\/a>, kter\u00fd d\u00edky patentovan\u00e9 technologii <strong>Max&#8217;s StarBoost<\/strong> umo\u017e\u0148uje v\u00a0re\u00e1ln\u00fdch podm\u00ednk\u00e1ch dos\u00e1hnout citlivosti u\u017e ppb \u010di ppt.<\/p>\n<p>T\u011bchto jedine\u010dn\u00fdch parametr\u016f dosahuj\u00ed FT-IR analyz\u00e1tory MAX-iR nejen d\u00edky technologii StarBoost, ale tak\u00e9 d\u00edky povaze samotn\u00e9 infra\u010derven\u00e9 spektroskopie: Ka\u017ed\u00e1 molekula m\u00e1 sv\u00e9 unik\u00e1tn\u00ed vibrace, a tak je pomoc\u00ed v\u00fdsledn\u00e9ho spektra mo\u017en\u00e9 analyzovat v\u00edce plyn\u016f z\u00e1rove\u0148. Za necelou minutu tak z\u00edsk\u00e1te informace o koncentrac\u00edch v\u0161ech sledovan\u00fdch slo\u017eek sm\u011bsi a m\u016f\u017eete samoz\u0159ejm\u011b analyzovat i komplexn\u00ed vzorky.<\/p>\n<p>Krom\u011b toho, \u017ee s analyz\u00e1tory MAX-iR m\u016f\u017eete vyu\u017e\u00edt v\u0161echny v\u00fdhody typick\u00e9 pro FT-IR spektroskopii, jako je extr\u00e9mn\u00ed rychlost, n\u00edzk\u00e9 n\u00e1klady na provoz, \u00fadr\u017ebu i anal\u00fdzu a jednoduchost ovl\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed, jsou vybaveny desetimetrovou plynovou celou, kter\u00e1 poskytuje v\u00fdjime\u010dnou citlivost m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed, a technick\u00e9 proveden\u00ed, kter\u00e9 nevy\u017eaduje chlazen\u00ed tekut\u00fdm dus\u00edkem. Nav\u00edc jsou spektrometry ovl\u00e1dan\u00e9 programem, ve kter\u00e9m jsou obsa\u017eeny rozs\u00e1hl\u00e9 spektr\u00e1ln\u00ed knihovny, kter\u00e9 umo\u017e\u0148uj\u00ed mj. i identifikaci nezn\u00e1m\u00fdch l\u00e1tek a v\u00fdvoj vlastn\u00edch metod. V\u00edce informac\u00ed naleznete <a href=\"https:\/\/www.azom.com\/article.aspx?ArticleID=22162&amp;cta=button_3&amp;elqtrack=true\">zde<\/a>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Pro mnoh\u00e9 pr\u016fmyslov\u00e9 procesy je naprosto z\u00e1sadn\u00ed m\u00edt spolehlivou techniku, kter\u00e1 umo\u017e\u0148uje rychlou, jednoduchou, p\u0159esnou a bezpe\u010dnou anal\u00fdzu plyn\u016f. Tradi\u010dn\u011b u\u017e\u00edvan\u00e9 metody jako CG \u010di CG-MS jsou v\u0161ak pomal\u00e9 a provoz takov\u00fdch p\u0159\u00edstroj\u016f je p\u0159\u00edli\u0161 n\u00e1kladn\u00fd. Proto se p\u0159\u00edmo nab\u00edz\u00ed zam\u011b\u0159it pozornost na techniky molekulov\u00e9 spektroskopie. Spole\u010dnost Thermo Scientific nab\u00edz\u00ed p\u0159evratn\u00fd FT-IR analyz\u00e1tor plyn\u016f MAX-iR, [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":11093,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"fo